---
import '../styles/global.css';
---
<html lang="ceb">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
    <title>Wala makit-i ang panid · Pamilihang Carbon</title>
  </head>
  <body class="min-h-screen grid place-items-center p-6">
    <main class="price-tag max-w-xl p-8 text-center">
      <p class="kicker">404 · Nasayop ug liko</p>
      <h1 class="display mt-5 text-6xl sm:text-7xl">Wala diri ang imong gipangita.</h1>
      <p class="mt-5 text-[var(--muted)]">Balik sa punoang panid ug sugdi pag-usab ang imong suroy sa Carbon.</p>
      <a href="/" class="mt-8 inline-flex border-2 border-[var(--ink)] bg-[var(--market-orange)] px-5 py-3 font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider shadow-[4px_4px_0_var(--ink)]">Balik sa Carbon</a>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
